<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sunbeam said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sunbeam said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Scott Graham upgraded Sunbeam Corp to buy from market performer, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 24-1/8.</p>
